 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Language resources for facts versus inferences",
     "texto": [
      "1. **Verified facts (Fakten)**: they are expressed with the **direct indicative** and verified-certainty formulas: **Es ist eine gesicherte Tatsache, dass...** (it is a verified fact that...), **Messungen beweisen, dass...** (measurements prove that...).",
      "2. **Inferences and deductions (Schlussfolgerungen)**: formulated with **subjective modal verbs** (**muss... gewesen sein** = must have been; **dürfte... sein** = probably is; **könnte... vorliegen** = could have been present) or with Konjunktiv II."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Statement",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Type of statement",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Distinctive grammatical marker",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
     "filas": [
